 * Proof steps:
001. DB = DC [00] & DA = DB [01] & DE = DA [02] & DH = DE [06] ⇒  A,C,H,B are concyclic [10]
002. DB = DC [00] & DA = DB [01] & DE = DA [02] & DI = DE [08] & DH = DE [06] & A,C,H,B are concyclic [10] ⇒  H,E,B,I are concyclic [11]
