008. ∠HEI = ∠HBI [12] & F,H,E are collinear [07] & G,I,E are collinear [09] & ∠(GI-FH) = ∠CAF [15] & A,F,B are collinear [03] & ∠CAB = ∠CHB [16] ⇒  ∠CHB = ∠IBH [17]
